    "intro_narrative": "You've infiltrated the underground server farm of 'Syndicate Zero', a rogue cyber-terrorist organization planning to wipe out global banking records. The air is frigid, humming with the low vibration of thousands of liquid-cooled servers. The blast doors have sealed shut behind you, and the automated network purge will begin in exactly sixty minutes. Your objective is to navigate their labyrinthine network of hardware encryptors, biometric vaults, and black-box routers. You must find the correct sequence of cryptographic handshakes and data injections to reach their core override console. One wrong move, and the data vanishes forever. Analyze the environment, link the scattered server nodes, and halt the purge.",
    "narrative_style": "techno_thriller"
